---
/* About page (T9): per report §7.2. Copy is DRAFT — founder approval at CP2a. */
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About — Brimwood Innovation"
  description="Brimwood Innovation is a selective innovation hub in Toronto for ambitious people building AI-powered micro businesses. Elite by effort, not by background."
  path="/about"
>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">About</div>
    <h1 class="sec" style="font-size:clamp(34px,5.4vw,56px);margin-bottom:18px;">A room where builders become owners.</h1>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      Brimwood Innovation is a selective innovation hub in Toronto for ambitious
      people building AI-powered micro businesses.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">Why we exist</div>
    <h2 class="sec">The story</h2>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      Most people with the drive to build something of their own never get a fair
      run at it. Not for lack of talent — for lack of room, skills, and people
      who take them seriously.
    </p>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      Brimwood is that room. A physical hub, hands-on AI training, and a small
      vetted community of people building real micro businesses. We build
      alongside our members — not above them.
    </p>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      Build a business. Build yourself. The two were never separate.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">The standard</div>
    <h2 class="sec">Elite by effort, not by background.</h2>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      We do not care where you went to school or who you know. We care what you
      do every week. Membership asks three things:
    </p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Show up</h3><p>Be in the room. Collision hours and demo nights only work if people come.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Ship weekly</h3><p>Something real, every week. Small is fine. Stalled is not.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Be generous</h3><p>Share what you learn. The community compounds when everyone teaches.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">The hub</div>
    <h2 class="sec">A real room, not a group chat</h2>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      1365 Gerrard St E Unit 2, Toronto. A build floor for deep work, collision
      hours for bumping into the right people, and Friday demo nights where
      members show what they shipped.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">The rhythm</div>
    <h2 class="sec">How the week runs</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><div class="n">MON</div><h3>Commit</h3><p>Set the week's build target. Say it out loud.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="n">WED</div><h3>Forge</h3><p>Build together. Get unblocked fast.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="n">FRI</div><h3>Show + dine</h3><p>Demo what shipped. Eat together.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="n">MONTHLY</div><h3>Public demos</h3><p>Open the doors. Show the city.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="kicker">What we are not</div>
    <h2 class="sec">Clear about what this isn't</h2>
    <p class="sec-lede">
      Not a coworking desk rental. Not a course factory. Not an accelerator that
      takes a cut and disappears. We are a hub that builds alongside its members,
      for the long term.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="introduce">
    <div class="cta">
      <h2>Membership is by invitation.</h2>
      <p>If you build, you belong here. Request an introduction and tell us what you're working on.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/#introduce">Request an introduction</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
